        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "h_cdf",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "### CDF replication\n",
                "\n",
                "Lakebase Change Data Feed captures every insert, update and delete from the write-ahead log and stores it as a new row in a Unity Catalog managed Delta table, batched and flushed every ~15 seconds. Replication latency is the time from the commit in Postgres until the change is written to the Delta table. Reference: [Lakebase Change Data Feed](https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/oltp/projects/lakebase-cdf)."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 30,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 2
          }
        },
